---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Join a Trip',href:'/join-a-trip/'}];
const packages=[
 {title:'Active & Trekking Departures',price:'Selected',copy:'Hiking, mountain, and active journeys for travelers or smaller groups joining a shared departure.',image:images.trekking,features:['Published dates & meeting point','Daily route and activity level','Accommodation & transport','Readiness requirements','Full inclusions & terms']},
 {title:'Learn-To Departures',price:'Skill-led',copy:'Trips built around instruction, practice, progression, and destination time, with prerequisites explained before booking.',image:images.surf,features:['Qualified instruction','Equipment assumptions','Beginner or progression level','Recovery & destination time','Published provider requirements']},
 {title:'Culture, Coast & Cruise',price:'Hosted',copy:'Hosted journeys with more emphasis on culture, social travel, comfort, and selected active experiences.',image:images.coast,features:['Shared anchor experiences','Flexible independent time','Arrival & group coordination','Pre/post travel options','Clear hosted program']}
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Join a Trip | Upcoming Talon Expeditions Departures" description="Selected Talon Expeditions hosted and small-group departures including active, learn-to, cultural, cruise, and experience-led travel." image={images.coast} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.coast}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>Tour Packages</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-package-head"><p class="eyebrow">Join a Talon Trip</p><h2>Selected Departures for Travelers Who Don’t Need to Bring the Whole Group</h2><p>Private groups are the center of Talon Expeditions. Public departures are released selectively when the itinerary, supplier structure, dates, participation requirements, pricing, and booking terms are ready to explain properly.</p></div><div class="av-package-grid">{packages.map((item,index)=><article class:list={['av-package-card',index===1&&'featured']}><span class="eyebrow">Departure Format</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><div class="av-package-price">{item.price}</div><p>{item.copy}</p><ul>{item.features.map((feature)=><li>{feature}</li>)}</ul><a class="button" href="/contact/">Ask About Departures</a></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="av-newsletter-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.train}')`}><div class="shell av-newsletter-grid"><div class="av-newsletter-card"><p class="eyebrow">Departure Interest</p><h2>Hear when a real trip is ready to publish.</h2><p>Tell us what kinds of trips interest you. This helps us understand demand and contact you when an appropriate joinable departure is ready. It is not a booking or deposit.</p><a class="button button-small" href="mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com?subject=Talon%20Expeditions%20Departure%20Interest">Register Interest</a></div><div class="av-stat-row"><div class="av-stat"><strong>Dates</strong><span>Published before booking</span></div><div class="av-stat"><strong>Price</strong><span>Clear inclusions & extras</span></div><div class="av-stat"><strong>Fit</strong><span>Activity & requirements</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="av-process"><div class="shell av-process-grid"><div class="av-process-visual" style={`background-image:url('${images.group}')`}><div class="av-process-callout"><h3>Bring Your Own Group?</h3><p>You do not need to wait for a public departure. Private groups can plan around their own dates and interests.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-copy"><p class="eyebrow">How Public Trips Work</p><h2>A real trip page should answer the questions before asking for a deposit.</h2><p class="av-process-lead">Every published departure should provide enough operational detail for a traveler to evaluate the trip, not just a destination photo and price.</p><div class="av-process-topline"><strong>Plan a private departure instead</strong><a href="/private-group-travel/">↗</a></div><div class="av-process-steps"><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">⌖</div><div><h3>Dates & Meeting Point</h3><p>Exact dates, start/end locations, and arrival expectations.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">▣</div><div><h3>Daily Experience</h3><p>Route, activities, accommodation, pace, and free time.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">$</div><div><h3>Price & Inclusions</h3><p>Included items, likely extras, room assumptions, and payments.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">✓</div><div><h3>Readiness & Terms</h3><p>Fitness, skills, equipment, documents, insurance, and conditions.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
